<title>UK: BAe falls on Eurofighter worries.</title>
<headline>BAe falls on Eurofighter worries.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in British Aerospace fell 25-1/2 pence to 1226-1/2 pence following worries over the success of the multinational Eurofighter project, dealers said.</p>
<p>The worries were triggered by comments from German Defence Minister Volker Ruehe, who on Monday declined to rule out that Germany could pull out of the project.</p>
<p>British Aerospace is one of four partners in the Eurofighter consortium.</p>
</text>
